Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please insert coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.93,0:00:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, time to slowly get\Ncrushed into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems the nefarious Netherlord can't\Nsee me, which only changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next up, I'll cleverly spend\Nthe points I have left.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.90,0:00:32.78,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(325,310)\fad(191,1)\c&H724C3D&\3c&HE6DBD3&\shad0\fs15}Gas Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess who's good as new?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Small call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.09,0:00:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These babies are used in dioramas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and according to my research, they're\Nthe smallest vending machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.11,0:01:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully the nether dork\Nthinks I kicked the bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.35,0:01:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd better camouflage\Nmyself just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.49,0:01:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd he make a supersized\Nsummoning circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.03,0:01:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red alert!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.33,0:01:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That freak combined\Nall the Stratum bosses!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.19,0:01:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ruh-roh, that means this mad\Nmonster's packing peak power!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nuntil the dungeon collapses.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold, as I entomb that foolish demon\Nlord and assert control over my own domain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's how I wound up living\Nunderground for four whole days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bunkered up with telekinesis\Nand concrete blocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plus flowers for a splash of color.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is lonesome being\Nburied alive, but it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know Lamas will give\Nit her all to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.89,0:02:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Lamas, you've come such a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we met,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other hunters thought you were useless and\Nyou'd even been abandoned by your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.45,0:02:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that must have\Nhurt like the dickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.93,0:02:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But check out your glow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.91,0:02:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're an able hunter and a household\Nname in the Clearflow Lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.87,0:02:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've literally had your\Nback this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So just thinking about\Nit gets me all verklempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She told me we could\Nstay together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.83,0:02:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once this little mess is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.31,0:02:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no doubt she'll help me conquer\Nanother dungeon to become human again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.27,0:02:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems the rest of the gang\Nwants to tag along too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Road trip baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I can keep adventuring with\Nthis rowdy yet lovable band of misfits,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.61,0:02:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.11,0:02:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welp, time for the yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show these meanies what\Nvending machines are made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.85,0:03:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fox Show!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.27,0:03:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner, Lamas!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.70,0:03:29.75,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo! Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.09,0:03:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My poison cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.13,0:03:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not put down...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not put down...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:52.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't have a clue... Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be a scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.87,0:03:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not looking at vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go anywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.05,0:04:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have a lot of fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.19,0:04:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.83,0:04:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you let, you play...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.01,0:04:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only time you got into the mode...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.23,0:04:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.83,0:04:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding a dream self.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.07,0:04:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know what I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding a dream in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding my head. head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.11,0:04:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding my thigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.59,0:04:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding my head.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.10,0:04:41.02,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,1)\fscx50\pos(526,55.4)}The Thumb General
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.99,0:04:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.41,0:04:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:04:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bobco!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:04:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Lammis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.93,0:05:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bob, I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.55,0:05:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hang in there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm digging you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.11,0:05:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, phew, glad you're not squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's feeling worried sick about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have known you'd be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.59,0:05:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not broken, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or scratched up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so... Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're lucky to be in one piece,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.07,0:05:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you don't always have\Nto push your luck, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.89,0:05:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's it going, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.89,0:05:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it too soon to ask you\Nto dish out some snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo's been dug out, can you dig it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always knew you'd make\Nit out of this, okay, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:50.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beyond a shadow of a doubt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your humor leaves a lot to\Nbe desired, Director Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.47,0:05:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:06:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The directors are safe and sound,\Nbut wait, where's the bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.43,0:06:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's every when.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.79,0:06:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, all of our friends are safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear and the others are busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're pursuing the monster horde.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.75,0:06:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing my buddies are okay\Nis a huge load off my ram.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, time to get vending.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing as how the town was destroyed,\Nthere aren't a ton of food options.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This calls for a lavish feast.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.71,0:06:28.21,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (top left),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs15}Megumi Natural Water
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.31,0:06:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.63,0:06:28.21,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (upper right),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H454E4D&\3c&HA7CEC6&}Deep-Fried Chicken
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.67,0:06:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty to go around, so\Njust wait your turn, everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.00,0:06:28.22,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H314941&\3c&HA6CFC4&}Oden
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.13,0:06:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And remember, be fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Children and old people go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't try to cut the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.33,0:06:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want some free food?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you're gonna flip\Nwhen you taste this stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.99,0:06:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, I doled out packaged prezis\Nuntil the wee hours of the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.41,0:06:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure we've got enough\Nboxo food to last a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.57,0:06:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since they're not gonna starve, we\Ncan go catch up with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.53,0:07:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm told Captain Carry Oil's family\Nwent after the monster horde.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Director Bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.31,0:07:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.22,0:07:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy, and Mishuel are in a mad dash to\Nbeat the beasts to the fortified city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better make sure you take a\Nlittle break if you need to, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.83,0:07:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.19,0:07:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live a little, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.65,0:07:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your hands to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.45,0:07:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know you've been through a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's probably a good idea\Nto take it easy for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those four stayed up all night with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.31,0:07:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I won't stop till the job is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never change, do you, kiddo? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.33,0:07:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting so old you wake up\Nearly does have its perks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.47,0:07:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My skin's not porcinum,\Nbut aging's not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.53,0:07:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Collagen's overrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The senior squad came equipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.53,0:08:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks they want to tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.07,0:08:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Count me in too, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.03,0:08:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess they're coming\Nalong for the ride too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.53,0:08:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate getting up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sound like a spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.31,0:08:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Splash some water on your face\Nand pull yourself together, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our team will remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll work on rebuilding the town. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.99,0:08:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I don't have to\Nworry about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I'm leaving it in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.09,0:08:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do men always sneak\Naway in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll miss you, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammy, please be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure to give him help for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Sneak you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is everyone ready\Nto get going? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.03,0:08:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a tad silly to be\Nhiding behind a tree like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.49,0:08:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd be able to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleased to make your acquaintance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:09:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I deeply apologize for all the\Ntrouble my naughty son has caused you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.63,0:09:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who's this alleged\Nson you're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, how spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.19,0:09:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ribby's pernicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my little rascal, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.09,0:09:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, lady, not to be mean, but is\NRibby in the room with us right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.59,0:09:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he was a child, he was\Nso quiet and mild-mannered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.85,0:09:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you suppose I went wrong\Nfor him to turn out the way he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Ribby, I hear he goes\Nby a different name these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was, oh, now I\Nremember, the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Nether Mama showed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.59,0:09:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a plot twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.53,0:09:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know kids like to rebel,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I still can't believe he\Nexperimented on his own mother to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.45,0:09:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get that skeleton body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if that weren't bad enough,\Nhe also won't let me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.13,0:09:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he be so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used his own mother as a test\Nsubject for his twisted dark art.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, Netherlord, I knew you were mega-scum,\Nbut this is full-on psycho territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.45,0:10:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, a mother's love is eternal,\Nso I forgive him for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.35,0:10:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm the Thumb\NGeneral and I strike down
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.59,0:10:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anyone who dares to stand in my son's way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a good mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.41,0:10:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, so just to be clear,\Nare you gonna try and kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mother's love is nothing\Nif it's not unconditional!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.11,0:10:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lovely maternal\Nsentiment on paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't entail aiding mass murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems to me you're a\Nsorry excuse for a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.21,0:10:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a child's misbehaving, it's a\Nmother's duty to smack some sense into us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.43,0:10:49.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The situation you just described isn't\Na mother's love, it's indulgence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.53,0:10:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you condemn me when\NI've given him everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.45,0:10:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you fool see that I'm\Nthe best mother there ever was?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the world except\Nmy ribby and me can die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The apple didn't fall far from the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's clearly no point trying\Nto reason with the thumb general
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who isn't fighting,\Nfollow me to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think we'd let\Nyou get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.99,0:11:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cowards are ganging up on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's inexcusable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.05,0:11:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,John, it's feeding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks like the summoning circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The netherlord used.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty clear where this is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a real bad feeling\Nabout that summoning circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, gramps!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it really be that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could that mana is downright alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be a monster from another.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.47,0:11:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy Isekai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.77,0:12:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that weird monster-shaped thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen more than my fair share of\Nmonsters here, but that thing's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.55,0:12:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo! Boxxo! Boxxo!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.93,0:12:14.02,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\pos(496,20)\fad(446,1)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.23,0:12:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.45,0:12:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can leave this nasty fella to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all itching to get in on the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you get as old as we are, you're\Ntoo short on time to bother with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:39.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, the two of you still\Nfind ways to scare me occasionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does get intense when\Nyou two are arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, now I'm doubly fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.03,0:12:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forces of justice\Nfighting back against evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.69,0:12:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is what dreams are made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:12:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shimmer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, things are getting hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.57,0:13:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like these buggies like to\Nexplode whenever you blast them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this becomes a war of attrition,\Nstamina could be a real problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.97,0:13:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I could distract our opponent\Nwith some kind of elaborate display.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm a freaking vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tend it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, er, work!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freddie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.85,0:13:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole sky's sparkling!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fireworks are always something special,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's nothing like\Nyour very first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the big bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not really advancing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's also facing away from\Nthe fireworks, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.85,0:13:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hunch was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:14:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Thumb General is the one\Npulling its gross little strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simply gorgeous. Lock it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you need something, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hit it for O. Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm ranked three,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can spawn concrete blocks\Nnearby instead of just under me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, you want me to throw these?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.07,0:14:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.27,0:14:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the Thumb General. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.59,0:14:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turned into a cardboard vending\Nmachine just before she threw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.11,0:14:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't get anywhere\Nnear the thumb general.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I factored Lamas' bad\Naim into the equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.78,0:14:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could watch them\Nwith my little ribby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.97,0:15:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our defeat of the thumb general\Ncalls for a victory dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.27,0:15:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that would mean crashing\Nand burning, so maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.21,0:15:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I have an exit strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.49,0:15:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be in the clear now. Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this weird Field feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.19,0:15:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, you did something crazy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.55,0:15:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think I'm gonna let you off\Nthe hook just cause you're adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.25,0:15:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it vanquished or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without its summoner\Nbinding it to this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that beast went back from whence it came.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Textbook monster summoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That takes care of, well, the side\Nstory, which still leaves the main plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta hurry and\Ncatch up to our friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:15:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:16:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mythical vehicle vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.29,0:16:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Famous amongst fellow\Nvending machine enthusiasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the uninitiated behold its glory,\Nthey often mistake it for a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, are you going to\Ngive us another Acar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.03,0:16:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our party's gotten pretty bloated,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the ground's not flat\Nlike the everlasting stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.01,0:16:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta take the bumpy\Nterrain into account.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.91,0:16:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pickup truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That A-car looks different\Nfrom the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely a lot\Nbigger than our old one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.23,0:16:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.95,0:16:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of these roads are uneven, so I know\Ndispensing a truck was the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.51,0:16:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of room\Neven with yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.03,0:16:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since it's a foreign build, the\Nstandard size is still huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.91,0:16:51.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really starting to\Nlike driving this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.03,0:16:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go a little faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.79,0:16:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a pleasant drive,\Nbut it's almost lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what I should\Nfeed my friends today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I know just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My pals are in for a tasty treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blammo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pizza vending machine baked to\Norder with all the right topics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an authentic Italian model.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.71,0:17:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is looks good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.47,0:17:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what is this crazy stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pull it apart and it gets so stretchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was such a hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They ate it all in record time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.91,0:17:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't hold out on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pop out the good stuff already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:35.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, someone's addicted, but\NI only vend, I don't judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.77,0:17:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy everyone loves my\Nhot and ready pizza so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird, they barely touched their zah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be too heavy for their\Nancient tummies to handle!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.85,0:17:48.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (big; left),0,0,0,,{\pos(292,103)\c&H32312C&\3c&HEDEAED&\shad0\bord4\fs24\fad(527,1)}Soba
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.85,0:17:48.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (big; right),0,0,0,,{\c&H32312C&\3c&HEDEAED&\shad0\bord2\fs24\pos(397,93)\fad(527,1)}Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.45,0:17:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of you to\Nfuss over us like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.77,0:17:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing was interesting,\Nbut just a little too rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for thinking of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I hate to waste\Nperfectly good food. No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.17,0:18:02.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui, those are all\Nyours if you want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.07,0:18:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm dreaming, you'll be here\Ntill I'm done eating, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Chewy, your stomach's\Nas bottomless as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:09.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to be safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll load her up on lots of burgers and\Nfried chicken before we hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo, can I have\None of those fizzy drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.55,0:18:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to devise a plan\Nto stop the Netherlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.01,0:18:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His powers are a pain in the\Nrear, but with all these points,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I could use\Nmy barrier to blow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, my tummy's feeling a little\Nangry, so how about a little snack?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.69,0:18:34.36,sign_Verdana,text (1st box),0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H9C9CB7&\3c&HB3BDB4&\shad0\bord4\fs15}Tater-\NTater\NFries
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.02,0:18:34.36,sign_Verdana,text (2nd box),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H797776&\3c&H8B8581&\shad0\bord4}Pasta\Nwith Cream Sauce
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.61,0:18:34.36,sign_Arial,text (4th box),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H756C65&\3c&HABA29A&\shad0\fax0.02\fs10\pos(531,188)\frz330.7\fad231,1)}Egg Sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.91,0:18:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just wait to attack until his\Ntummy's angry. No, focus! Let's think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of the Finger Generals, I've defeated\Nthe thumb and the middle fingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ring finger General\NSulream switched sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.99,0:18:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, I'm still starving over here!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.75,0:18:49.87,sign_Arial,text (2nd box),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H4C211E&\3c&H7F7A74&\shad0\fax0.02\fs10\frz-30.96\fad(231,1)\pos(337,259)}Ham Sandwich
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.29,0:18:49.87,sign_Arial,text (4th box),0,0,0,,{\frz20.11\fax-0.06\c&H4C211E&\3c&H615B58&\fs15\shad0\pos(239,320)\fad(108,1)}Cream Puff
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.89,0:18:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The diabetes-inducing\Nsweetbread general... Dadnobbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.47,0:18:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the last two\Ngenerals will be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pinky general got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's no telling\Nwhere the forefinger...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need something really sweet to help\Nwash down all that tasty food now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there's the dreaded juice general.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you stop distracting me, Sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.55,0:19:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am this close to letting Hulemy\Ndissect your stomach for science!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting any less thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shwee's had enough sugar\Nto kill a grown elephant,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.15,0:19:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so let's try a zero-calorie beverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.21,0:19:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is something off\Nabout the sweetness of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tastes okay, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.59,0:19:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She not only eats a lot, but it seems\Nher sense of taste is also shockingly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and annoyingly refined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.17,0:19:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not thinking something\Nrude, are you, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gaining what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's gaining weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.61,0:19:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.44,0:19:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of\Na bulking phase, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fat Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.79,0:19:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's against the law to\Ntalk about a girl's weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.78,0:19:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:48.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The road trip went smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No accidents or illegal\Nfat comments to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only took us a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This contraption sure is handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see things in the far\Noff distance, clear as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to revel\Nin the glory of vending!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.75,0:20:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh dear! Gramps!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.69,0:20:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to shout, I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.33,0:20:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up ahead, there's a standoff\Nagainst a horde of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me have a gander.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.53,0:20:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.05,0:20:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not loving their odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poor saps are outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're way out here, does\Nthat mean what I think it does?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy, head right and make\Nthis thing go even faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.05,0:20:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.65,0:20:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all kinds of bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're completely surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.23,0:20:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With them packed so tightly together,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be too dangerous\Nto try a magic strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure we'd try to set it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.83,0:20:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Shui Lion, Director Scorching\Ncan't push the wind button?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.35,0:20:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should probably tell Hulemy\Nto find somewhere safe to park.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, hold on to your butts, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, move it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.49,0:20:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to warn ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew we'd find them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.59,0:20:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should've known you'd show\Nup just in the nick of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.31,0:20:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, let's move the wounded\Ninside Boxo's Barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can still move, carry\Nsomebody who can't inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.67,0:21:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, they're the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.25,0:21:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.75,0:21:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:08.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you healed up in a jiffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch. Cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.89,0:21:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.05,0:21:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You as well, big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.47,0:21:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too hot to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watching my friends commit acts of\Nviolence reminds me how lucky I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.77,0:21:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're OP compared to other hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.61,0:21:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I don't mean\Nto bust out my arrows.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.23,0:21:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not wrong, but she's also not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.59,0:21:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to put that lazy tushy to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you gotta be so\Nmean, Boxo? Oh, Chewie,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't I teach you if you\Nhave time to run your mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have time to pull your weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.73,0:21:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, you said it a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.73,0:21:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, is it just me or is\NChewie frightened of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, I should stop dwelling on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.43,0:21:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, the battle ended in victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.67,0:21:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my friends laying the\Nsmackdown on those jabronis,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the final battle is almost upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxo, I could use a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.03,0:22:08.65,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Translation:\N{\fs18.5}Duane Johnson\N{\fs15}Timing:\N{\fs18.5}Edgar Cruz
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.97,0:22:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a great story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.41,0:22:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be like you for a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.65,0:22:12.62,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Editing:\N{\fs18.5}Alicia Ashby\N{\fs15}Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Salem Alabanza
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.01,0:22:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you. I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.78,0:22:17.66,sign_Arial,,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fs15\shad0\3c&H3F3F3F&\bord1.5}Final Quality Control:\N{\fs18.5}Michelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.77,0:22:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.49,0:22:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.29,0:22:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.39,0:22:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.43,0:22:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.65,0:22:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.29,0:23:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make a good. Make a\Nround of moon. Make you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.07,0:23:40.15,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.07,0:23:40.15,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (bottom right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs21\fsp1\pos(341.2,299.8)}I Am a Field without Equal

